  "title": "Steph&#39;s Zesty Sweet and Sour Meatballs",
  "description": "Meatballs in a sweet-and-sour sauce made with brown sugar, apple cider vinegar, soy sauce, and canned pineapple make a zesty dinner treat.",
  "authors": [
